Here is a self-contained implementation and a small JUnit 5 test suite. It parses a 5-field cron (minute, hour, day-of-month, month, day-of-week), supports *, lists, ranges, and steps, and computes the next matching time strictly after a given ZonedDateTime. Everything is evaluated in UTC.

